ell><mxCell id="n64" value="server" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#E65100;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.1;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n32" target="n33"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n65" value="EtherCAT / TCP" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n33" target="n35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n66" value="Modbus TCP" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.2;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n34" target="n35"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n67" value="DI 13~16 상태" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#6A1B9A;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n10" target="n28"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n68" value="pub" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0;exitY=0.2;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n24" target="n19"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n69" value="pub" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n24" target="n20"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n70" value="sub" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.8;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n21" target="n24"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n71" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n19" target="n11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n72" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;html=1;fontSize=10;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;exitX=1;exitY=0.8;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="n11" target="n21"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n73" value="범례 / 표기 규칙&lt;br&gt;  ▬ 초록 실선  : publish&lt;br&gt;  ▭ 초록 점선  : subscribe&lt;br&gt;  ▬ 주황 실선  : service client / server&lt;br&gt;  ▬ 보라 실선  : ROS 외 통신 (HTTP·WS·Modbus·EtherCAT·DI)&lt;br&gt;  ⬡ 초록 육각형 : 토픽        ⬡ 주황 육각형 : 서비스&lt;br&gt;  ⬜ 빨강 점선 박스 : 본 zip 에 소스가 없는 구성요소&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;실행 순서&lt;br&gt;  1) ros2 launch m0609_rg2_bringup bringup.launch.py mode:=real host:=192.168.1.100 model:=m0609&lt;br&gt;  2) ros2 run rokey coffee_system          (setup.py 미등록 — 현재 entry_points 보완 필요)&lt;br&gt;  3) python3 -m rokey.web_ui               (uvicorn :8000)&lt;br&gt;  4) ros2 run rokey plate_monitor          (선택 — 독립 계측 도구)" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f9f7ed;strokeColor=#b5a642;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="790" width="620" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n74" value="⚠ 문서화 중 확인된 정합성 이슈&lt;br&gt;  1. setup.py entry_points 에 coffee_system / web_ui 미등록&lt;br&gt;     (등록된 simple_move, F_3_drl_sun_gear 는 소스 부재)&lt;br&gt;  2. web_ui.py 가 import 하는 monitor_pjt.system_monitor 모듈 부재&lt;br&gt;     → /system_monitor/* 3개 토픽의 상대편 노드 없음&lt;br&gt;  3. package.xml 에 fastapi/uvicorn/numpy/onrobot_rg_msgs/sensor_msgs 의존성 누락&lt;br&gt;  4. /coffee_system/status 를 두 노드가 동시 발행 (main + web_control)&lt;br&gt;     → TRANSIENT_LOCAL latch 상태가 부분 payload 로 덮일 수 있음" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f9f7ed;strokeColor=#b5a642;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1040" y="1030" width="660" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="04_Sequence_그립실패복구" id="04_Sequence_그립실패복구"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="04. 시퀀스 다이어그램 — 그립 실패(GripFailureError) 복구" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="close_and_verify_grip() 실패 → screen 10 → DI13 관리자 호출 → DI14 정리완료 → 단계 재시작" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="56" width="1100" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="운영자 / 물리버튼&lt;br&gt;DI 13 · DI 14" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="110" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="160" y="174" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="160" y="1520" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="공정 스레드&lt;br&gt;run_protected_stage()&lt;br&gt;+ StatusReporter" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=10;verticalAlign=middle" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="355" y="110" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="470" y="174" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="470" y="1520" as="targe