etry></mxCell><mxCell id="n42" value="retry_count += 1 → continue → grinder 단계 처음부터 재실행" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=9;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=middle" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="480" y="1222" width="340" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n43" value="publish: phase=STAGE_RESTARTED, screen=4, progress=42&lt;br&gt;(stage_recovery_ui[&apos;grinder&apos;])" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="470" y="1284" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1710" y="1284" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n44" value="begin_stage(&apos;grinder&apos;) — 재시도 1회차" style="html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;rounded=0;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=10;verticalAlign=bottom;align=center;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="470" y="1336" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="780" y="1336" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n45" value="핵심 관찰점&lt;br&gt;  · 그립 실패 경로에서는 motion/move_stop 을 호출하지 않는다.&lt;br&gt;    이미 모션이 끝난 뒤의 &apos;검증 실패&apos;이므로 로봇은 정지 상태다.&lt;br&gt;    → 신호 유실(05 페이지) 경로와 구분되는 지점.&lt;br&gt;  · 재시도 단위는 &apos;단계 전체&apos;이며 부분 재개가 없다.&lt;br&gt;  · 재시도 횟수 상한이 없어 rclpy.ok() 동안 무한 반복 가능.&lt;br&gt;  · GRIP_VERIFY_TIMEOUT_SEC = 2.0s / GRIP_SIGNAL_TIMEOUT_SEC = 1.0s&lt;br&gt;  · verify_grip 중 새 표본을 아예 못 받으면 GripFailure 가 아니라&lt;br&gt;    force_signal_loss() → GripperSignalLostError 로 승격된다." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f9f7ed;strokeColor=#b5a642;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="1560" width="700" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n46" value="범례&lt;br&gt;  ▬ 검정 실선 화살표 : 동기 호출 / 명령&lt;br&gt;  ▭ 회색 점선 화살표 : 반환값 · 대기&lt;br&gt;  ▬ 초록 굵은 화살표 : ROS 토픽 publish&lt;br&gt;  ▭ 노랑 박스        : self-call (같은 lifeline 내부 처리)&lt;br&gt;  ▭ 보라 점선 프레임 : ref / alt / loop 상호작용 조각" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#f9f7ed;strokeColor=#b5a642;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="800" y="1560" width="520" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram><diagram name="05_Sequence_그리퍼신호유실복구" id="05_Sequence_그리퍼신호유실복구"><mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1654" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value="05. 시퀀스 다이어그램 — 그리퍼 신호 유실(GripperSignalLostError) 복구" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#333333" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value="GripMonitor 워치독 감지 → motion/move_stop → screen 11 → 신호 안정화 → DI13 + 3초 카운트다운 → 단계 재시작" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="56" width="1100" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value="운영자 / 물리버튼&lt;br&gt;DI 13" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSize=10" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="110" width="230" height="64" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" style="endArrow=none;dashed=1;html=1;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="160" y="174" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="160" y="1800" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="공정 스레드&lt;br&gt;guarded_motion / recover_gripper_signal" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;arcSiz